#. §0: `Continuous`
#. §1: ```
#. class Continuous {X Y : Type} [TopologicalSpace X] [TopologicalSpace Y] (f : X → Y) where
#.   isOpen_preimage : ∀ {U : Set Y}, IsOpen U → IsOpen (f ⁻¹' U)
#. ```
