msgid "You can use the §0 tactic to work backwards from the goal.  Suppose you think that you\n"
"will be able to use some theorem §1 to prove the goal.  In other words, you think there\n"
"is a proof of the goal of the form §2, where the question mark needs to be replaced\n"
"with a proof of some statement §3 to which the theorem §4 must be applied.  The tactic\n"
"§5 will then set §6 as your goal.  If §7 must be applied to more than one proof to\n"
"establish the goal, then §8 will set all of the needed proofs as goals."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `apply Iff.intro`
#: Game.Levels.Inter.L08inter_assoc
