#: Game.Levels.Empty.L01_empty_set
msgid "In this level, we introduce the empty set, denoted §0.\n"
"We show that for any set §1, the empty set is a subset of §2.\n"
"\n"
"The only thing you need to know about the empty set is that it has no elements.\n"
"This is stated in the theorem §3.\n"
"For any §4, §5 is a proof that §6."
msgstr ""

