#: Game.Levels.Subset.L01exact
msgid "Congratulations! You have completed your first verified proof!\n"
"\n"
"Although this theorem was trivial, it illustrates an important fact: although we\n"
"called §0 an *identifier* for the assumption §1, it is also recognized by Lean\n"
"as a *proof* of the statement §2.  Any time you see §3\n"
"listed as an assumption, where §4 is some statement, that means that Lean will\n"
"recognize §5 as a proof of the statement §6.\n"
"\n"
"Remember that §7 is a *tactic*. If you ever want information about the §8 tactic,\n"
"you can click on §9 in the list of tactics on the right.\n"
"\n"
"Note that, although §10 was a proof of the goal §11, you could not have closed the goal by\n"
"simply typing §12 in the text box.  Throughout this game, every move you make must invoke a tactic.\n"
"\n"
"Now click on \"Next\" to see a more interesting use of the §13 tactic."
msgstr ""

