#. §0: `IsPreconnected`
#. §1: ```
#. def IsPreconnected (s : Set α) : Prop :=
#.   ∀ u v : Set α, IsOpen u → IsOpen v → s ⊆ u ∪ v → (s ∩ u).Nonempty → (s ∩ v).Nonempty →
#.     (s ∩ (u ∩ v)).Nonempty
#. ```
#. §2: `s`
#. §3: `α`
#. §4: `u`
#. §5: `v`
#. §6: `α`
#. §7: `s ⊆ u ∪ v`
#. §8: `s ∩ u`
#. §9: `s ∩ v`
#. §10: `s ∩ (u ∩ v)`
#. §11: `IsPreconnected`
#. §12: `rw [IsPreconnected]`
#: Game.Levels.Connected.L01_preconnected
msgid "In this level, we introduce preconnected sets.\n"
"\n"
"The §0 property is defined as follows.\n"
"§1\n"
"In words, a set §2 in a topological space §3 is _preconnected_ if,\n"
"for any two open sets §4 and §5 in §6  such that\n"
"§7, §8 is nonempty and §9 is nonempty,\n"
"we have that §10 is nonempty.\n"
"\n"
"You can treat §11 as a theorem. Typing §12 will unfold the definition."
msgstr ""

